<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Incyte started with buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Incyte started with buy.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alex Brown said Monday it started coverage on the shares of Incyte Pharmaceuticals Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- The stock lost 1-1/4 to 63-1/4.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk))</p>
</text>
